0..76 Comment "// The cancellation subject\'s shared declarations, written once and imported"
77..154 Comment "// by every source that reads them (`import \"./cancel-base.gandr\" ;`): a task"
155..229 Comment "// hands its parent what it found over its end. A cancellation point is an"
230..305 Comment "// operation a capability scope answers; its clause resumes the rest of the"
306..382 Comment "// scope once or abandons it, and an abandoned end is cancelled for its peer"
383..444 Comment "// (Fowler, Lindley, Morris and Decova, doi:10.1145/3290341)."
446..522 Comment "/// A task: the protocol its end carries back to the parent, and the path it"
523..533 Comment "/// reads."
